      "statement": "The API exposes three endpoints: POST /applications, GET /applications/{id} (decision, reason codes, offered terms) and POST /applications/{id}/counteroffer; submissions carry product, applicant, bureauConsentToken and an Idempotency-Key header, and responses return id, decision, creditLine, apr, pdBand and reasonCodes.",
